"available version. Snapd re-execution is supported on Ubuntu. The versions "
"listed above are usually only relevant before the installation of the first "
"snap. Outside of unusual circumstances, the Ubuntu package is synchronized "
"from Debian. This process stops once an upcoming Ubuntu release is entering "
"feature freeze."
