#: ../../../reference/administration/distribution-support.md:50
msgid ""
"Fedora allows updating packages in stable distributions. You can expect all "
"snapd releases to be updated within a week or two of the upstream release, "
"following the usual testing and migration process. Due to ABI "
"incompatibilities, differences in build configuration process and "
"distribution policy snapd re-execution  is not supported on Fedora."
msgstr ""

